      "title": "Notes",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# DICE-Talk Native\n- `duration = 0` -> use the whole audio (frame count follows the audio). `duration > 0` is a MAX cap in seconds.\n- `fps` on the Sampler is the **adm micro-condition** (official 12.5). It is NOT the output frame rate.\n- Output rate: RIFE returns `fps*2` (25). Set CreateVideo/SaveVideo fps to 25 when RIFE is used, 12.5 without it.\n- VRAM: this UNet is ~3.1 GB fp16 but the sliding window runs 3 CFG branches x 25 frames per window.\n  On a 12 GB card 512 px + long audio will hit shared memory (10-20x slower). Use a shorter `duration`, or a smaller `min_resolution`.\n- Emotion: pick one of emotions/*.npy; `emotion_guidance` (default 6.0) is the emotion strength, `appearance_guidance` (default 3.0) is identity preservation.\n- `ip_audio_scale` / `ip_emo_scale` on the Loader are the IP-Adapter branch weights (official 1.0 / 1.0).\n- A different `seed` changes motion + expression phase; the reference identity is anchored by the c_concat latent."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# DICE-Talk Native\n- `duration = 0` -> use the whole audio (frame count follows the audio). `duration > 0` is a MAX cap in seconds.\n- `fps` on the Sampler is the **adm micro-condition** (official 12.5). It is NOT the output frame rate.\n- Output rate: RIFE returns `fps*2` (25). Set CreateVideo/SaveVideo fps to 25 when RIFE is used, 12.5 without it.\n- VRAM: this UNet is ~3.1 GB fp16 but the sliding window runs 3 CFG branches x 25 frames per window.\n  On a 12 GB card 512 px + long audio will hit shared memory (10-20x slower). Use a shorter `duration`, or a smaller `min_resolution`.\n- Emotion: pick one of emotions/*.npy; `emotion_guidance` (default 6.0) is the emotion strength, `appearance_guidance` (default 3.0) is identity preservation.\n- `ip_audio_scale` / `ip_emo_scale` on the Loader are the IP-Adapter branch weights (official 1.0 / 1.0).\n- A different `seed` changes motion + expression phase; the reference identity is anchored by the c_concat latent."
      },
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
